<title>ITALY: Italian bond futures hit new record high.</title>
<headline>Italian bond futures hit new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian September LIFFE contract hit a new record high in early trading on Wednesday, soaring to 136.72 before easing back by five basis points.</p>
<p>The spread between BTPs and the benchmark Bund narrowed to a record 93 basis points. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
